Package: gghisse
Title: Summarise and Visualise 'hisse' Model Results
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: 
    c(person(given = "Teofil",
             family = "Nakov",
             role = c("aut", "cre"),
             email = "teofiln@gmail.com"),
