Description: Summarise and plot results from Hidden State Speciation and
    Extinction (HiSSE) and Multicharacter Hidden State Speciation and
    Extinction (MuHiSSE) models fit with the 'hisse' package. Processes
    marginal ancestral state reconstructions into tidy tables of
    model-averaged tip and node rates and states. Plots diversification
    rates, trait and rate reconstructions on phylogenies, and transition
    rates with 'ggplot2' and 'ggtree'. Includes a 'Shiny' application for
    exploring results interactively.
URL: https://github.com/discindo/gghisse, https://discindo.github.io/gghisse/
